    - rid: 191267363641360576
      type: {class: DialogueNodeEditorData, ns: jbzd.Dialogues.Editor.Save, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data:
        <ID>k__BackingField: 8030b5dc-3a16-49c6-a49f-6d31dfe929ee
        <Choices>k__BackingField:
        - <Text>k__BackingField: Nastepny dialog
          <NodeID>k__BackingField: c14a76ce-e40a-4339-8a75-c1b71ac9d2bd
        <GroupID>k__BackingField: 8981eea4-5b4d-456f-ae38-f7ac98a9556a
        <NodeType>k__BackingField: 0
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 347, y: 8}
        <Text>k__BackingField: "Anon to z pozoru zwyk\u0142y siedemnastolatek, b\u0119d\u0105cy
          w\u0142a\u015Bnie na ko\u0144cu okresu dojrzewania. UNTIL HE WASN'T!"
        <PlayerImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <NpcImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <Audio>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <IsPlayerTalking>k__BackingField: 0
    - rid: 191267363641360577
      type: {class: DialogueNodeEditorData, ns: jbzd.Dialogues.Editor.Save, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data:
        <ID>k__BackingField: 21ac47b4-a615-42f2-b537-92b15a90c055
        <Choices>k__BackingField:
        - <Text>k__BackingField: Nastepny dialog
          <NodeID>k__BackingField: 660e39c2-afeb-4eb5-8f5a-58b52d83201e
        <GroupID>k__BackingField: 8981eea4-5b4d-456f-ae38-f7ac98a9556a
        <NodeType>k__BackingField: 0
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 1736, y: 33}
        <Text>k__BackingField: "Hehe, \u017Cart wyruchany dwa razy, klasyka."
        <PlayerImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <NpcImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <Audio>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <IsPlayerTalking>k__BackingField: 0
    - rid: 191267363641360578
      type: {class: DialogueNodeEditorData, ns: jbzd.Dialogues.Editor.Save, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data:
        <ID>k__BackingField: c14a76ce-e40a-4339-8a75-c1b71ac9d2bd
        <Choices>k__BackingField:
        - <Text>k__BackingField: Nastepny dialog
          <NodeID>k__BackingField: 21ac47b4-a615-42f2-b537-92b15a90c055
        <GroupID>k__BackingField: 8981eea4-5b4d-456f-ae38-f7ac98a9556a
        <NodeType>k__BackingField: 0
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 1053, y: 26}
        <Text>k__BackingField: "\u017Bart w kilku pierwszych sekundach gry, nie\u017Ale,
          nie? (chrz\u0105kni\u0119cie) Na pierwszy rzut oka w\u0142a\u015Bnie tym
          mo\u017Cna by wyt\u0142umaczy\u0107 jego introwertyczne podej\u015Bcie
          do r\xF3wie\u015Bnik\xF3w czy problemy wychowawcze. Jednak prawda jest
          zupe\u0142nie inna. Ch\u0142opak \u017Cyje na jednym z miejskich blokowisk
          razem ze swoj\u0105 patologiczn\u0105 matk\u0105 i niestroni\u0105cym od
          alkoholu ojczymem, przez kt\xF3rych jest traktowany jak s\u0142u\u017C\u0105cy.
          Problemy w rodzinie s\u0105 powodem, dla kt\xF3rych Anon zamyka si\u0119
          w sobie, jest nie\u015Bmia\u0142y w podej\u015Bciu do dziewczyn oraz pozwala
          na ka\u017Cdym kroku sob\u0105 pomiata\u0107. Dzie\u0144, od kt\xF3rego
          zaczniemy nasz\u0105 histori\u0119, zapowiada\u0142 si\u0119 jak ka\u017Cdy
          inny w jego dotychczasowym \u017Cyciu..."
        <PlayerImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <NpcImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <Audio>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <IsPlayerTalking>k__BackingField: 0
    - rid: 191267363641360579
      type: {class: DialogueNodeEditorData, ns: jbzd.Dialogues.Editor.Save, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data:
        <ID>k__BackingField: 660e39c2-afeb-4eb5-8f5a-58b52d83201e
        <Choices>k__BackingField:
        - <Text>k__BackingField: Nastepny dialog
          <NodeID>k__BackingField: afad093f-24f5-47b4-aafb-77d4948a1f94
        <GroupID>k__BackingField: 8981eea4-5b4d-456f-ae38-f7ac98a9556a
        <NodeType>k__BackingField: 0
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 2258, y: 28}
        <Text>k__BackingField: "Anon, kurwa! Chod\u017A tu natychmiast!"
        <PlayerImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <NpcImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <Audio>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <IsPlayerTalking>k__BackingField: 0
    - rid: 191267363641360580
      type: {class: DialogueNodeEditorData, ns: jbzd.Dialogues.Editor.Save, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data:
        <ID>k__BackingField: 204e782a-61f2-46e6-a570-73bbbf19036e
        <Choices>k__BackingField:
        - <Text>k__BackingField: Nastepny dialog
          <NodeID>k__BackingField: 95fd2504-f233-4cab-8a87-05efaaf0a814
        <GroupID>k__BackingField: d89631dc-3f1e-4b45-9689-4485013a8cb3
        <NodeType>k__BackingField: 0
        <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 362, y: 568}
        <Text>k__BackingField: "Nic nie robisz, tylko chlejesz piwsko ca\u0142ymi
          dniami i jeszcze moje wychla\u0142e\u015B! Matka mia\u0142a racj\u0119,
          co do ciebie...!"
        <PlayerImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <NpcImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <Audio>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
        <IsPlayerTalking>k__BackingField: 0
    - rid: 191267363641360581
      type: {class: DialogueNodeEditorData, ns: jbzd.Dialogues.Editor.Save, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data:
        <ID>k__BackingField: 95fd2504-f233-4cab-8a87-05efaaf0a814
